Package: SCP
Type: Package
Title: Simulation-Based Circadian Power Analysis with K-harmonic LRT
Version: 0.4.0
Date: 2026-05-09
Authors@R: person("Thien Quy", "Pham",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "quythien14@gmail.com",
    comment = c(affiliation = "University of Pittsburgh"))
Maintainer: Thien Quy Pham <quythien14@gmail.com>
Description: Provides simulation-based power analysis for circadian rhythm
    studies using a semiparametric framework. Empirical parameter distributions
    are estimated from pilot gene-expression data, and power is evaluated for
    rhythmicity detection and differential-rhythm tests (DR, DP, DM) across a
    range of study designs. Includes the DCP pipeline, FMM waveform robustness
    assessment, and a bootstrap design-grid optimizer.
